ExtractKit — third-party license notice
==================================

This folder contains decompression code mechanically ported from the 7-Zip /
LZMA SDK reference sources (Igor Pavlov), primarily 7-Zip 26.02.

Upstream:
  https://www.7-zip.org/
  https://www.7-zip.org/sdk.html

